Vending
Machine of the new Millennium.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Finally after two years of studies =
and market
research, in occasion of the <b><a =
href=3D"http://www.euvend.com">Eu&#039;Vend 2003</a></b>,
Datamarche srl will present Vera, the<b> first</b> and <b>only Vending =
Machine</b>
that caters exclusively to &quot; <b><a =
href=3D"http://www.veryitaliano.it">Very
Italiano</a></b>&quot;, the Made in Italy pasta.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Eu&#039;Vend 2003, which takes place =
f<b>rom the 11th
to the 13th of September in Cologne</b>, is the trade show that caters =
for the
world of Vending Machines. It is here that this new system will have its =
world
premiere. <br>
<br>
With its unique ability to recognise the foods that have to be heated =
and
together with the other <b>4 patents owned by Very Italiano</b>, it is =
sure to
be the main attraction and the most original at the German =
Fair.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Vera was created by the association =
between a
Jesi company (<b><a =
href=3D"http://www.gruppodatamarche.it">http://www.gruppodatamarche.it</a=
></b>),
Jofemar (<b><a =
href=3D"http://www.jofemar.co">http://www.jofemar.com</a></b>) the
world leader in the construction of Vending Machines and the Italian =
branch of
LG-Electronics (<a =
href=3D"http://www.lge.com"><b>http://www.lge.com</b></a>)
leader in the field of ovens and microwaves.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Apart from the product Very Italiano, =
the first
high quality I.Q.F. pasta offered in a practical and original paper cup, =
the
other strong points of the vending machine are: =B7 <br>
</font></p>
<ul>
  <li><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">The dimensions of the Vending =
Machine =B7 </font></li>
  <li><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">The ease with which the product =
can be loaded
    by the operator and simplicity with which the consumer can use the =
machine
    =B7 </font></li>
  <li><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">The option of heating three =
products
    simultaneously thus avoiding long and useless waits (especially =
during peak
    times) =B7 </font></li>
  <li><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Separate use of the freezer (the =
actual
    vending machine) and the tower with the three microwave ovens (used =
in
    serviced areas) =B7 </font></li>
  <li><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Optimal cooking of each dish =
inserted in the
    microwaves =B7 </font></li>
  <li><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Ideal for universities, schools, =
barracks,
    factories, airports, petrol stations, cinemas, etc.</font></li>
</ul>
<p><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">As well as the launch of the Vending =
Machine, a
form of <b>Franchising will be proposed</b>. It will be based on the =
concession
of regional exclusivity of the product Very Italiano and of the Vending =
Machine.
If you are interested in receiving an invitation to the Fair and =
scheduling a
meeting at our stand: </font></p>
<p align=3D"center"><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2"><b>Hall01.2 <br>
Aisle: D <br>
No: 010 </b></font></p>
<p align=3D"left"><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2"><br>
or for further information on the product and the event, we request you =
reply to
this letter leaving your full name and address. You will be contacted by =
one of
our agents as soon as possible.</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Best regards</font></p>
<p><font face=3D"Arial" size=3D"2">Gruppo Datamarche/E-Labs</font></p>
